  npcID: Old Man Yal & Old Man Mochi
  npcName: Old Man Yal & Old Man Mochi
  FirstTimeDialogue:
  - You should never leave the village.
  - Only trouble lies beyond our walls.
  ReturnedDialogue:
  - Mushrooms bounce, platforms move, this is life, nothing new.
  ThirdDialogue:
  - "These young mice wander out to the forest and they don\u2019t come back. "
  - 'Sqik. '
  - "They just don\u2019t listen to us.  "
  - 'Always learning things the hard way.  '
  - 'Sqik. '
